.TH MOXY-LIST-MOXINS 1 "" "moxy"
.SH NAME
moxy-list-moxins \- List available builtin moxins
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B moxy list-moxins
.SH DESCRIPTION
Enumerates moxins from the system moxin directory and MOXIN_PATH, printing each name and description. Useful for discovering which moxins can be served standalone via 'moxy serve-moxin'.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR moxy (1)
